{"schema_version":"iteris.verification_result.v0","request_id":"verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d","backend":"agent","mode":"fact","claim":"The v2 covariantly damped Maxwell-Debye layer is not perfectly matched at a planar constant x-PML interface, with the squared-admittance mismatch stated in the fact file.","verdict":"accepted","passed":true,"strict_verdict":"correct","summary":"Correct. The cited stage-3 proof uses the verified covariantly damped Maxwell-Debye model from the predecessor fact and the source TM sign conventions. For the physical Maxwell-Debye half-space, the Laplace-Fourier symbol gives H_x=-ik_y E/(mu s), H_y=nu_0 E/(mu s), nu_0^2=k_y^2+mu s^2 A(s), hence Y_0^2=A(s)/mu+k_y^2/(mu^2 s^2). For the constant x-layer v2 model with rho_x=rho>0 and rho_y=0, the same symbol gives P=chi E/(1+tau(s+rho)), H_x=-ik_y E/(mu s), H_y=nu E/(mu(s+rho)), nu^2=mu(s+rho)^2 A_rho(s)+k_y^2(s+rho)/s, hence Y_rho^2=A_rho(s)/mu+k_y^2/(mu^2 s(s+rho)). Subtracting gives exactly -rho[chi tau/(mu(1+tau(s+rho))(1+tau s))+k_y^2/(mu^2 s^2(s+rho))], matching the fact file and the boxed formula in the proof artifact. Since this expression is not identically zero for rho>0 under the stated positive Debye parameters, the admittance mismatch is generically nonzero and the continuous planar-interface reflection coefficient is generically nonzero. The claim is scoped to this planar constant-coefficient x-interface test and does not overclaim more.","critical_errors":[],"gaps":[],"repair_hints":"","checked_artifacts":["verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d/request.json","memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-v2-covariant-model-not-perfectly-matched.md","artifacts/proofs/stage3_v2_perfect_matching_test.md","results/energy_design_v2_report_verified.md","memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-covariantly-damped-debye-energy.md","verification/results